{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 285, "line_no": 2, "text": "荒坡和山林等生产资料，在中华人民共和国成立前，除私人占有部分外，每个村寨都", "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 249, "w": 1463, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "荒坡和山林等生产资料，在中华人民共和国成立前，除私人占有部分外，每个村寨都", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 249, "w": 1463, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 285, "line_no": 3, "text": "有一片公有山林，供全寨性的事务和祭祀等用。此外，各宗族还有自己的公共荒山和山", "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 318, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "有一片公有山林，供全寨性的事务和祭祀等用。此外，各宗族还有自己的公共荒山和山", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 318, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 285, "line_no": 4, "text": "林等，作为家族坟山或供全宗族集体事务用。这些公有荒山、山林，任何个人或外村寨、", "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 378, "w": 1552, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "林等，作为家族坟山或供全宗族集体事务用。这些公有荒山、山林，任何个人或外村寨、", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 378, "w": 1552, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 285, "line_no": 5, "text": "外宗族的人不能擅自占用。", "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 447, "w": 478, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "外宗族的人不能擅自占用。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 447, "w": 478, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 285, "line_no": 6, "text": "其他方面，如生产工具、牲畜等，其所有权均属个人，他人不得占有。", "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 507, "w": 1170, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "其他方面，如生产工具、牲畜等，其所有权均属个人，他人不得占有。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 507, "w": 1170, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 285, "line_no": 7, "text": "2. 分配习惯法", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 575, "w": 266, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "2. 分配习惯法", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 575, "w": 266, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 285, "line_no": 8, "text": "布依族早已进入阶级社会，但原始公社时期盛行的平均主义分配方式仍在很多方面", "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 636, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族早已进入阶级社会，但原始公社时期盛行的平均主义分配方式仍在很多方面", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 636, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 285, "line_no": 9, "text": "有不同程度的表现。上山打猎，见者有份，就是这种分配方式最突出的表现。布依族是", "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 700, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "有不同程度的表现。上山打猎，见者有份，就是这种分配方式最突出的表现。布依族是", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 700, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 285, "line_no": 10, "text": "农业民族，狩猎在大多数地区只是季节性的活动。如果狩猎者捕捉到猎物，过路碰见者", "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 772, "w": 1540, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "农业民族，狩猎在大多数地区只是季节性的活动。如果狩猎者捕捉到猎物，过路碰见者", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 772, "w": 1540, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 285, "line_no": 11, "text": "即使没有参加，也可分到一份。", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 837, "w": 531, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "即使没有参加，也可分到一份。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 837, "w": 531, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 285, "line_no": 12, "text": "三月三、六月六祭山神，用来祭祀的猪肉大家共聚一餐后，剩余的采取平均分配，任", "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 893, "w": 1467, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "三月三、六月六祭山神，用来祭祀的猪肉大家共聚一餐后，剩余的采取平均分配，任", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 893, "w": 1467, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 285, "line_no": 13, "text": "何人不得多占。", "bbox_px": {"x": 136, "y": 963, "w": 270, "h": 54}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "何人不得多占。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 136, "y": 963, "w": 270, "h": 54}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 285, "line_no": 14, "text": "在手工艺行业内，师傅和徒弟之间、熟练者和初学者之间在分配上有一定差距。人", "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 1030, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "在手工艺行业内，师傅和徒弟之间、熟练者和初学者之间在分配上有一定差距。人", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 1030, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 285, "line_no": 15, "text": "们对此是能够接受的。但当熟练程度相当后，一般都采取平均分配方式，否则就很难继", "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 1090, "w": 1548, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "们对此是能够接受的。但当熟练程度相当后，一般都采取平均分配方式，否则就很难继", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 1090, "w": 1548, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 285, "line_no": 16, "text": "续合作共事。", "bbox_px": {"x": 136, "y": 1157, "w": 234, "h": 55}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "续合作共事。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 136, "y": 1157, "w": 234, "h": 55}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
